            "notes": "Field rations is great for this round, get on the point early and just stay there.  Try to make them push you off point.\n\nHaving the weapon/ability lifesteal is also pretty important, she can do a ton of constant damage which should keep you alive in between ability cooldowns.  Make sure to have some cover though because she is a gigantic target.\n\nYou can honestly go Compensator for weapon damage or Weapon Grease for attack speed, I prefer to go damage personally.  Just play her like a tank with lifesteal the first round, and reflect everyones projectiles at them before they get used to it.",
