            "notes": "So getting Vanadium Injection asap is pretty important, Orisa's ult is not the best, and the movement speed alone makes it feel worth it. Efi's Theorem is also very important with this round's power choice.  I would probably go for Efi's Theorem first if you didn't make enough money as it will let you tank a lot harder.\n\nAny extra money, spend on cooldown reduction items, whatever you want at the moment, at this point you'll have 20% ability lifesteal at least, which means all the reflected damage you do with javelin spin gives you 20% of the health of that attack back. from here on out you pretty much just spec as much cooldown reduction as you can and start throwing in some debuffs.",
