            "notes": "This round is where my build can truly diverge into almost a different build.   For this version, it is a pure tank mode build, but I do also like getting the Shield Divergence power if the enemy team has a lot of ranged characters (Ashe/Soldier also Sigma/Orisa).  For this version, I go full blown tank, so Hooves of Steel is just some added ridiculous amounts of tank to annoy the other team since they can't ever kill you.  \n\nIf the enemy team has a really good healer,make sure you have Cybervenom.  If they have a bunch of fast characters (Lucio, Genji, D.va) get Liquid Nitrogen asap.\n\nAny extra money, go for cooldown reduction however you can.",
